# IPC Debugger — Implementation Plan

A web-based tool for visualizing and debugging Inter-Process Communication. Built as a single-page application with rich animations, dark-mode aesthetics, and interactive simulations.

## Proposed Changes

### Project Structure

```
OS PROJECT/
├── index.html          # Main entry point
├── css/
│   └── styles.css      # Design system + all styles
├── js/
│   ├── app.js          # Main app controller, dashboard
│   ├── process.js      # Process simulator
│   ├── pipe.js         # Pipe IPC mechanism
│   ├── messageQueue.js # Message Queue IPC mechanism
│   ├── sharedMemory.js # Shared Memory IPC mechanism
│   ├── semaphore.js    # Semaphore synchronization
│   ├── debugger.js     # Deadlock, race, bottleneck detection
│   ├── visualizer.js   # Canvas/SVG rendering of processes & connections
│   ├── timeline.js     # Timeline view
│   └── logger.js       # Event logging & report export
└── assets/
    └── favicon.ico
```

> [!NOTE]
> Using vanilla HTML/CSS/JS (no frameworks) to keep it simple, portable, and easy to present in a viva. Opens directly in a browser — no build tools needed.

