### Debugging Engine — `js/debugger.js`

#### [NEW] [debugger.js](file:///c:/Users/MSI%20PC/Desktop/ACADEMICS/SEMISTERS/SEMISTER%20FOUR/CSE316%20OPERATING%20SYSTEMS/OS%20PROJECT/js/debugger.js)

- **Deadlock Detection**: Builds a wait-for graph from process resource requests; runs cycle detection (DFS) to find circular waits
- **Race Condition Detection**: Monitors shared memory accesses; flags concurrent writes without semaphore lock
- **Bottleneck Detection**: Checks queue occupancy, pipe buffer fullness, process wait durations
- Returns alerts with severity (info, warning, critical) and involved processes

